      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">            Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;is a fully open-access journal; all<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        the articles it publishes are immediately and permanently open to the public<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        without the need for a subscription or any access restrictions in order to<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        promote the global spread of scientific knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Open Access License&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The journal offers full open access;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        all of its content is made freely available as soon as it is published on the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        basis of a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        which permits wide sharing and use for non-commercial purposes provided that<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        appropriate credit is given.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Copyright&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The authors who publish in the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        Journal retain the copyright over their work; upon submitting and publishing an<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        article, the authors grant the publisher a non-exclusive licence to publish,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        distribute and display the work as the official version of record.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Author Rights/ Commercial Use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Authors retain full ownership and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
