      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The editors of &lt;em&gt;ISAR Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/em&gt;apply good<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        publishing practices in line with the policies of the Publishing Ethics<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        Committee &lt;a href=&quot;https://publicationethics.org/membership/code-of-conduct&quot;&gt;COPE&lt;/a&gt;.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Authors, editors and reviewers<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        should follow the principles of good practices in the field of publication<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        ethics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Authors are expected to be aware of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        ethical principles and apply good practices in the field of publication ethics,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        in particular: authorship and co-authorship (for example avoiding ghost or<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        guest authorship), originality, plagiarism, data manipulation, conflict of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        interest and ethical compliance research.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reviewers and editors are required<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        to treat the texts in a fair and confidential manner and to declare any<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        conflicts of interest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;In case of suspected violation of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        ethical rules regarding improper conduct of research or publication, we will<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        conduct an investigation and, if necessary, we reserve the right to contact the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        institutions of authors, financiers or regulators. In cases of ambiguous<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        nature, the final decision is taken by the Editor-in-Chief.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Antiplagiarism procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Journal introduces an<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        anti-plagiarism system. All texts will be entered into the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ithenticate.com/&quot;&gt;iThenticate.com&lt;/a&gt; system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;In the event of suspected<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        wrongdoing, we will apply the explanatory procedure in accordance with the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        guidelines of the COPE Committee. If we find convincing evidence of misconduct,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        we will take steps to correct the scientific documentation, which may include<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        correction or withdrawal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Please report all doubts and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        concerns regarding potential misconduct to the journal&#039;s e-mail. You must first<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        inform the editor-in-chief of the journal. Readers who have doubts about the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">        use of good practices are asked to contact the journal directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Using AI tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Procedures for the use of AI: &lt;a href=&quot;https://isarpublisher.com/GenerativeAIPolicy&quot;&gt;AI Principles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2787 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
