","articles":"<pre class=sf-dump id=sf-dump-1714066090 data-indent-pad=\"  \"><span class=sf-dump-note>array:5</span> [<samp data-depth=1 class=sf-dump-expanded>
  <span class=sf-dump-index>0</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:22</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>1548</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>name</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"136 characters\">From Biblical Psalms to Catholic Religious Songs: Exploring the Role of Catholic Religious Music in Christian Spiritual Growth in Rwanda</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>slug</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"135 characters\">From-Biblical-Psalms-to-Catholic-Religious-Songs-Exploring-the-Role-of-Catholic-Religious-Music-in-Christian-Spiritual-Growth-in-Rwanda</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>aname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17 characters\">Laurent NTAGANDA*</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>abstract</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; margin: 8px 0in 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;; color: black;&quot;&gt;Catholic<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            religious music plays an important role in Christian worship and spiritual<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            formation in Rwanda, where biblical faith is expressed through local languages,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            cultural values, and musical traditions. This study, entitled From Biblical Psalms to Catholic Religious<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">                Songs: Exploring the Role of Catholic Religious Music in Christian Spiritual<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">                Growth in Rwanda, examines the relationship between the biblical Psalms<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            and Catholic religious songs and their contribution to Christian spiritual<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            growth. The study asks: How does Catholic religious music contribute to prayer,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            faith formation, personal conversion, Christian identity, and participation in<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            communal worship? It hypothesizes that Catholic religious music enhances<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            Christian spiritual growth when its biblical and theological content is<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            faithfully expressed through culturally meaningful forms. The objective is to<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            examine this relationship and assess the role of Catholic religious music in<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            Christian formation and evangelization. A descriptive mixed-methods design was<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            employed among 70 undergraduate students of the Faculty of Theology at the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            Catholic University of Rwanda (CUR). Data were collected through structured<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            questionnaires and analyzed using descriptive statistics and thematic analysis.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            Findings indicate that 95.7% of respondents viewed religious music as an aid to<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            prayer, 94.3% associated it with spiritual growth, 92.9% emphasized biblical<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            foundations, 91.4% perceived it as effective for faith formation, and 90.0%<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            reported increased participation in communal worship. The study concludes that<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            Catholic religious music is a valuable instrument of Christian formation and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2361 characters\">            evangelization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>designation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"30 characters\">Catholic University of Rwanda.</span>\"
