      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[2583-9691]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; is being published Monthly by<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
