      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The manuscript will be submitted<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    for double-blind review.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The editor will make the decision<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    following the double-blind review and will then communicate it to the author.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
