      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        explicit permission from the copyright holder(s).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;By submitting a manuscript to the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">        journal, authors agree to this open-access and licensing terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
