  <span class=sf-dump-index>1</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:22</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>1537</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>name</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"51 characters\">Practical classroom strategies for English teaching</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>slug</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"51 characters\">Practical-classroom-strategies-for-English-teaching</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>aname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"36 characters\">Mbuyiseni Jollies Sikhumbuzo Dlamini</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>abstract</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; margin: 8px 0in 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;This<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        research shows practical classroom strategies offered by teachers for English teaching<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        within secondary settings of education in Pietermaritzburg, South Africa. The<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        research utilized a qualitative method. Exclude the implementation of different<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        language laws; teachers frequently encounter instructional hurdles when<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        assisting comprehensive language acquisition among multilingual students. To<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        investigate these dynamics, the research involved 30 participants who answered<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        semi-structured interview questions, which provided insights into these<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        dynamics. The research involved 30 participants who answered semi-structured<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        interview questions, providing insights into daily pedagogical sessions,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        interactive instructional skills, and curriculum delivery mechanisms. The taken<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        data is made using NVivo software to systematically organize the transcripts of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        qualitative data, recognise recurring conceptual patterns, and manufacture<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        robust thematic codes. The information shows the critical requirement for<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        situation-responsive pedagogical frameworks, aimed literacy assist systems, and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        enhanced instructional engagement to optimize language results. This research<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        leads to actionable insights for refining classroom methodologies and elevating<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        overall educational levels in linguistically diverse places, offering a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        comprehensive start for the coming curriculum improvement and professional<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2000 characters\">        education practice across similar educational landscapes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
