      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 13px; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        Journal of Science and Technology (ISARJST)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt; is a monthly, open-access,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        peer-reviewed journal published by International Scientific and Academic<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        Research Publisher (ISAR Publisher). This international journal serves as a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        platform for the publication of research articles, reviews, and short<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        communications within the expansive domain of Science and Technology. Its<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        primary aim is to facilitate the exploration and dissemination of the most<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        recent trends and developments in these fields. IJST is committed to providing<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        researchers, scholars, and professionals with a comprehensive resource to stay<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        updated on cutting-edge advancements and contribute to the collective knowledge<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        base in Science and Technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 13px; line-height: 115%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;The<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2602 characters\">        scope of the &quot;ISAR Journal of Science and Technology (ISARJST)&quot;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
