      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>ISAR<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[2583-9691]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; is being published Monthly by<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    ISAR Publisher. It provides a high-quality, open access, peer-reviewed and fully<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    refereed international forum in the field of and Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Journal welcomes original papers, review papers,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    case studies, and academic exchanges, conceptual framework all the articles<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    compiled the research outcomes to new developments and approaches in this field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The subjects covered by the journal encompass a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">diverse range of fields and topics, including but not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Arts,<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>Journalism, Political<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Science, Social Studies,<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>Women studies, Fine Arts, Law,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Linguistics,<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>Archeology, Communication studies,    Criminology, Cross Cultural studies, History,<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>International Relations,<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>Literature, Media<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Studies, Performing arts (Music/Theatre/Dance),<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Psychology, Public administration, Religious Studies, Social Welfare,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">    Sociology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Note: &#8220;All submitted manuscripts undergo a rigorous peer-review process by at least two independent reviewers before acceptance.&#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Archiving &amp;amp;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">Preservation<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Published content is preserved in trusted digital repositories<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">(such as the &lt;a href=&quot;https://archive.org/details/@isar_publisher&quot;&gt;Internet Archive&lt;/a&gt;) and assigned permanent DOIs to ensure long-term<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1626 characters\">accessibility&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
