      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">&lt;p&gt;This is a fully open access<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">journal. Articles published in this journal are immediately and permanently<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">free for anyone to read, download, copy and share without registration or<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">subscription.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The journal offers full open<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">access; all of its content is made freely available as soon as it is published<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">on the basis of a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">License, which permits wide sharing and use for non-commercial purposes<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">provided that appropriate credit is given.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Authors retain full ownership and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">control over commercial uses of their work. Any commercial use by others<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">requires explicit permission from the copyright holder(s).&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
