    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>title</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"14 characters\">Review Process</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>slug</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"14 characters\">review-process</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>type</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7 characters\">content</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>system_key</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>content</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;It is at the core of proper<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    scholarly publishing and takes place in all respected scientific journals;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    accordingly, our referees have an important role to play in keeping the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    Journal&#039;s high standards and every manuscript is subjected to peer review in<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    accordance with the procedure set out below.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial manuscript evaluation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The Editor begins by looking at<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    all the manuscripts; although this is rare, it is entirely possible for a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    really good manuscript to be accepted right then. Manuscripts that satisfy the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    basic requirements are sent on to at least two experts to review them, and the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    authors of those manuscripts which are rejected at this stage will be notified.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type of Peer Review&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Manuscripts proceeding to peer<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    review are evaluated by members of an international panel of experts. Each<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    paper is subject to double-blind peer review by two or more independent<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    reviewers, under the supervision of the section editor and the Editor-in-Chief.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    While the journal makes every effort to ensure that authors&#8217; identities remain<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    anonymous during the review process, authors themselves bear responsibility for<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    concealing identifying details (e.g., in references to prior publications). If<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    a manuscript contains information that reveals author identity, the review will<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    be conducted in a single-blind format, meaning that reviewers remain anonymous<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    but authors do not.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The journal strives to complete<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    the peer review process within four weeks of the decision to review, although<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    occasional delays may occur. Authors are advised to allow up to 7 weeks from<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    the date of submission before contacting the editorial office. The<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    Editor-in-Chief retains full authority over the final decision on acceptance or<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    rejection.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How the reviewer is selected&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reviewers are assigned to the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    papers on the basis of their expertise. Although the authors are welcome to<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    suggest reviewers, the organisers may choose to accept or reject these<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">    suggestions.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reviewer reports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4324 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reviewers are asked to evaluate<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
