      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;Author Guidelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence (AI)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It is necessary to make clear in<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        the Author Statement accompanying each article that artificial intelligence<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        (AI) tools, including generative AI systems, have been used.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It is not possible to include AI<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        tools as authors or co-authors of a publication since authorship involves<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        making an intellectual contribution and taking on responsibility and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        accountability, aspects which can only be assigned to human authors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;AI can be used merely as a<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        supportive tool, for instance when carrying out language editing, grammar<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        correction or enhancing the clarity of the text. However, the authors must<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        still take full responsibility for the accuracy, integrity, originality and<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        scientific quality of the manuscript, including any content which has been<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        produced with the help of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It is not acceptable to use AI<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        tools to produce or create research data, analyses or references without the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        authors carrying out proper verification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Not stating the use of AI tools or<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        using such technologies improperly could lead to the manuscript being rejected<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        or to other editorial actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;Publishing Ethics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Policy on the Use of Artificial Intelligence in Manuscript Preparation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The journal acknowledges that<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        artificial intelligence (AI) tools could be used in the preparation of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        scholarly manuscripts. To ensure transparency and research integrity, the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        following principles are applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Authorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It is not possible to include<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        artificial intelligence tools as authors or co-authors since authorship<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        involves responsibility, accountability and an intellectual contribution which<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        cannot be assigned to AI systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Disclosure requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Authors are required to state that<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        they have used AI tools when preparing their manuscript, and this statement<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        should be placed in the Author Statement that is included with each article.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Author responsibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The authors are entirely<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        responsible for the content of their manuscript, including any text, analysis<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        or material which is produced with the help of AI technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Acceptable uses of AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;AI tools may be used for limited<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        purposes such as:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
