      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;Peer Review Process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reviewers must treat all materials<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        received for review as confidential documents. Reviewers should not upload<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        manuscripts or any part of them to artificial intelligence (AI) tools,<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        including generative AI systems, as this may compromise the confidentiality of<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        the submitted work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;AI tools can be used for only those<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        limited purposes which do not include sharing the manuscript content (such as<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        improving the language of the review report), and the reviewers are entirely<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        responsible for the content, quality and fairness of their evaluation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It must never happen that AI<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        systems are used to produce a peer review report without the reviewer having<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6001 characters\">        taken some intellectual part in it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
