      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1906 characters\">            Journal of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;is a fully open-access journal; all<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
